# readOnlyRootFilesystem is set on the stateless demo services (see demo/.devops), but the
# stateful demo containers can't run with a read-only root filesystem: Keycloak (start-dev)
# rebuilds Quarkus at boot and PostgreSQL needs writable runtime dirs. These are demo assets,
# not production workloads, so KSV-0014 is accepted for them.
AVD-KSV-0014
KSV0014

# The nginx-certbot reverse proxy (demo/.devops/nginx) runs as root by design: it binds
# 80/443 and runs certbot + cron for TLS. A non-root USER would break it. Demo asset.
AVD-DS-0002
DS0002
